  message: "CLOSED ON THE FILED INSTANCE (owner agreed 2026-09-30: close here, leave the residual on INV-votoj).\n\nFILED REPRO, RE-RUN TWICE on dev b16e3e9271 (the only commits between that and ece892ac3e are tracker .ops; source and tests are identical):\n  slot run suite -- scripts/smart-test --full --no-cov -n 5\n  (smart-test, not bare pytest; --full collects all 9 test roots, a superset of the row's 7 packages; the last -n 5 overrides the script's own -n 2)\n  run 1: 31729 passed, 8 skipped, 14 xfailed in 1935.63s, EXIT=0, 0 FAILED/ERROR lines\n  run 2: 31729 passed, 8 skipped, 14 xfailed in 1576.89s, EXIT=0, 0 FAILED/ERROR lines\n  test_taint_recall_corpus.py: no failures in either run (the filed pair, test_adjudication_label_does_not_depend_on_another_language and test_published_scope_distinguishes_capable_from_incapable, passed).\n  Logs: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/kogop_close_09302026/run{1,2}.txt and run{1,2}.pytest.log\n\nDETERMINISTIC PROBE of the real mechanism (this does not depend on xdist ordering):\n  clear the def/use registry, then reload only py_def_use -> registry = ['python'] (javascript gone, the filed poisoning state)\n  dataflow_scope.ensure_def_use_extractors_registered() -> javascript restored; the registry is a superset of the learned baseline\n  compute_dataflow_scope(TaintCatalog(), ['javascript','python']) after the same poisoning -> javascript dataflow_capable True\n\nMECHANISM: not the row's hypothesis (test_ddg_build's _preserve_registry). It was the DEF/USE registry, cleared by test_cfg.py and partly restored by test_py_def_use.py. Fixed by 4dcd87c0bf (2026-08-10, reload plus a subset check against a learned baseline) and f013cc7d13 (2026-09-19, INV-zunik: the baseline is one the function produced itself).\n\nNOT ASSERTED:\n  - That no worker distribution can reproduce it. Two runs at -n 5 are evidence about those orderings only. The probe covers the def/use half for any order.\n  - That other published fields are free of the same leak.\n  - The ddg_spec half: _DDG_LANGUAGES has no baseline guard. That residual stays with INV-votoj-zurit-kimov-majah-biriz-dozas-datal-lavip (item 1 of its unclosed list); handover note posted there."  # bdd8
